      "sentence_id": 21,
      "text": "...RESPONDENTS (BY SRI.V. SHIVAREDDY., AGA FOR R1 TO R5)\n THIS WP IS FILED UNDER ARTICLES 226 AND 227 OF THE CONSTITUTION OF INDIA PRAYING TO- ISSUE DIRECTIONS TO THE RESPONDENTS TO SEE THAT THE PETITIONER IS NOT HARASSED IN ANY MANNER BY ANY OFFICIALS IN CONNECTION WITH CC.NO.9960/2023 PENDING BEFORE HONBLE VII ADDITIONAL CHIEF METROPOLITAN MAGISTRATE,\nBENGALURU; QUASH THE NOTICE DATED 22.09.2023 ISSUED BY R5 AS PER ANNEXURE-C TO INITIATE AN INDEPENDENT INVESTIGATION PREFERABLY BY CENTRAL BUREAU OF INVESTIGATION (CBI) OF SPECIAL INVESTIGATION TEAM (SIT) INTO CONSPIRACY BY R5 TO ARREST THE PETITIONER AND HIS FAMILY MEMBERS BY FILING FALSE ABSCONDING REPORT AND OBTAINING NEW ORDER AGAINST THE  -3-  NC: 2025:KHC:44448  WP No. 23436 of 2023 HC-KAR Mr Kapil Manchanda vs State Of Karnataka on 4 November, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/184289800/\n2 PETITIONER AND HIS FAMILY MEMBERS IN CC.NO.9960/2023 PENDING BEFORE HONBLE VII ADDITIONAL CHIEF METROPOLITAN MAGISTRATE,\nBENGALURU; ISSUE DIRECTIONS TO THE R1 TO R3 TO HOLD ENQUIRY AND INITIATE DISCIPLINARY ACTION AGAINST R5 AND OTHER ERRANT POLICE OFFICIALS AND TAKE APPROPRIATE ACTION AGAINST THEM.",
