      "text": "THIS PETITION, COMING ON FOR PRELIMINARY HEARING IN 'B' GROUP, THIS DAY, ORDER WAS MADE THEREIN AS UNDER:\nCORAM: HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE B M SHYAM PRASAD  ORAL ORDER",
